    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d528">

                <pb facs="0648" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg580"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. John C. Wright to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1867-04-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 22, 1867.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 17th instant the King, in person,
                    closed the North German parliament. Enclosed will be found the speech in German
                    and a translation of the same. That portion of the address relating to South
                    Germany called forth hearty applause.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with great respect, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN C. WRIGHT.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d528-a1.xml" xpointer="d528-a1"/>
            </div>
